---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" current="About">
  <section class="page prose">
    <h2>Privacy policy</h2>
    <p><i>Last updated: November 10, 2026.</i></p>
    <h3>What we collect</h3>
    <p>Local Buzz ATX does not ask you to create an account and does not collect your name or email address on this site. Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, may process technical information such as your IP address and browser type to deliver the site and keep it secure.</p>
    <h3>Third parties</h3>
    <p>This site shows photos from news outlets and embeds videos from YouTube. Loading those may send information to those companies under their own privacy policies. Links to other sites, including affiliate links, take you to places we do not control.</p>
    <h3>Cookies and analytics</h3>
    <p>We do not set our own tracking cookies. If we add analytics or newsletter sign-ups later, this page will be updated first.</p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>A contact address will be listed here soon.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
